<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>OnlyPad — Every coin pays its creator</title>
<meta name="description" content="OnlyPad is a Solana launchpad on pump.fun where a coin's creator reward is split on chain: the creator's Cut straight to their wallet, Tips into an OnlyVault their Subs claim from, and 5% to the Pad. Hold longer, claim more.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0E0E0E">
<meta property="og:title" content="OnlyPad — Every coin pays its creator">
<meta property="og:description" content="Launch a coin for a creator. Every trade pays their cut straight to their wallet — and pays the Subs who hold it.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="brand/onlypad-favicon-64.png">
</head>
<body>

<!-- ================= NAV ================= -->
<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="nav__in">
    <a class="brand" href="#top">
      <img class="brand__mark" src="brand/onlypad-mark.png" alt="" width="30" height="30">
      <span class="brand__name">OnlyPad</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="nav__links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#board">Discover</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#jar">Holders</a>
      <a href="#token">$ONLY</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="nav__right">
      <button class="wbtn" id="walletBtn" type="button" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="wbtn__dot"></span><span id="walletLabel">Connect wallet</span>
      </button>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm nav__cta" href="#launch">Launch a coin</a>
      <button class="nav__burger" id="burger" type="button" aria-label="Menu"><span></span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__in">
    <span class="hero__badge rv">The creator-reward launchpad on Solana</span>
    <h1 class="h-xxl rv">Where coins <span class="accent">pay their creator</span></h1>
    <p class="lead hero__lead rv">
      Launch a coin for a creator and route its pump.fun creator reward <b>straight to their wallet</b> —
      while the people holding it claim <b>Tips</b> from an OnlyVault. Hold longer, claim more, and the
      creator keeps getting paid on every trade.
    </p>

    <div class="hero__cta rv">
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="#launch">Launch a coin</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="#board">See the launches</a>
    </div>

    <p class="hero__trust rv">
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
      Free to launch · Split written on chain at launch · The Cut is the creator's, not ours
      <a class="btnlink" href="#fees">Where the fees go →</a>
    </p>

    <p class="tagline hero__tagline rv">Made for the gooners, by the gooners</p>

    <!-- live activity feed -->
    <div class="feed rv">
      <div class="feed__h">
        <div>
          <div class="feed__t">Live activity</div>
          <div class="feed__s">Launches and payouts, as they happen</div>
        </div>
        <span class="pill pill--soft"><span class="dot dot-live"></span>live · demo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="feed__rows" id="tickerRows">
        <div class="empty">Loading the board…</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= FEE FLOW ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="fees">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="eyebrow">Where a creator reward goes</div>
      <h2 class="h-xl">Fixed at launch.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Every trade of an Only pays a creator reward. Here is exactly where it goes — and why it never stops paying.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flow flow--3">
      <div class="flow__source rv">
        <span class="n">ON EVERY TRADE OF AN ONLY, PUMP.FUN PAYS</span>
        <span class="h-md" style="margin-left:auto">The coin's creator reward</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flowcard flowcard--primary rv">
        <div class="flowcard__top">
          <span class="pill pill--accent">60%</span>
          <span class="dim mono" style="font-size:.7rem">launcher-set, 40–80%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flowcard__amount">60<small>%</small></div>
        <div class="flowcard__to">
          <span class="pill pill--soft">The Cut</span>
          <span class="flowcard__wallet">creator's wallet</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flowcard__arrow">paid to</div>
        <div class="flowcard__res">The creator's own Solana wallet, in SOL, on every trade. <b>Not ours, and not the launcher's.</b></div>
      </div>

      <div class="flowcard flowcard--secondary rv">
        <div class="flowcard__top">
          <span class="pill pill--accent">35%</span>
          <span class="dim mono" style="font-size:.7rem">onlyvault config</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flowcard__amount">35<small>%</small></div>
        <div class="flowcard__to">
          <span class="pill pill--neutral">OnlyVault</span>
          <span class="flowcard__wallet">per coin, for life</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flowcard__arrow">streams to</div>
        <div class="flowcard__res">The coin's <b>Subs</b>, who claim a share weighted by how long they have held without selling.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="flowcard flowcard--dim rv">
        <div class="flowcard__top">
          <span class="pill pill--neutral">5%</span>
          <span class="dim mono" style="font-size:.7rem">pad config</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flowcard__amount">5<small>%</small></div>
        <div class="flowcard__to">
          <span class="pill pill--neutral">Pad treasury</span>
          <span class="flowcard__wallet">the Pad</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flowcard__arrow">buys, then splits in half</div>
        <div class="flowcard__res"><b>$ONLY</b> on the open market. <b>Half is burned.</b> The other half drops into the <b>Tip Jar</b>, which Subs claim every 15 minutes.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow__resolver rv">
        <div class="ic">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="h-md">When a Sub claims</div>
          <p class="muted" style="font-size:.93rem;margin-top:7px">
            <b>Hold → your weight grows → your Tips grow.</b> Sell any amount and your sub streak resets, and
            everything you had accrued but not yet claimed goes back into the OnlyVault for the Subs who stayed.
            The vault never closes: later trades keep filling it. And the creator's Cut is unaffected by any of it —
            they are paid on every trade regardless of who holds.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= STATS ================= -->
<section class="sec sec--tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stats rv">
      <div class="stat stat--primary">
        <div class="stat__k">Onlys launched</div>
        <div class="stat__v" data-stat="onlys">—</div>
        <div class="stat__d">created here on pump.fun</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat stat--secondary">
        <div class="stat__k">Market cap</div>
        <div class="stat__v" data-stat="mcap">—</div>
        <div class="stat__d">across every Only launched here</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat__k">Volume 24h</div>
        <div class="stat__v" data-stat="vol24">—</div>
        <div class="stat__d">traded in the last day</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat stat--amber">
        <div class="stat__k">In Creator Escrow</div>
        <div class="stat__v" data-stat="escrow">—</div>
        <div class="stat__d">waiting for a creator to claim</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= LAUNCH ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="launch">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="eyebrow">Launch</div>
      <h2 class="h-xl">Launch a coin for someone.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Three steps, about a minute. Free to launch: you sign from your own wallet, and pump.fun writes the split on chain for good.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:18px"><a class="btnlink" href="#creators">Fan Launching for a creator? →</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="launch">
      <div class="steps">

        <!-- step 1 -->
        <div class="step is-active" id="step1">
          <div class="step__head">
            <div class="step__num">1</div>
            <div>
              <div class="step__title">Who is this for?</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step__sub">a creator, or a creator who hasn't opted in</div>
          <div class="step__body">
            <div class="modes" id="kindGroup" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr">
              <button class="mode is-on" type="button" data-kind="creator">
                <div class="mode__ic"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
                <div class="mode__t">Creator Launch</div>
                <div class="mode__d">You are the creator. The Cut streams to your wallet from the first trade.</div>
                <div class="mode__badge">VERIFIED</div>
              </button>
              <button class="mode" type="button" data-kind="fan">
                <div class="mode__ic"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 11c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"/></svg></div>
                <div class="mode__t">Fan Launch</div>
                <div class="mode__d">You are a fan. The Cut accrues in Creator Escrow until they verify and claim it.</div>
                <div class="mode__badge">UNCLAIMED</div>
              </button>
            </div>

            <p style="margin:22px 0 16px">Now pick the rule your Subs claim under. It is written into the coin's vault at launch and cannot be changed.</p>
            <div class="modes" id="modeGroup">
              <button class="mode is-on" type="button" data-mode="stream">
                <div class="mode__ic"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 12h4l3 8 4-16 3 8h4"/></svg></div>
                <div class="mode__t">Stream</div>
                <div class="mode__d">Tips accrue every second. Subs claim whenever they want, linear.</div>
                <div class="mode__badge">POPULAR</div>
              </button>
              <button class="mode" type="button" data-mode="ppv">
                <div class="mode__ic"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20h-20"/></svg></div>
                <div class="mode__t">PPV</div>
                <div class="mode__d">Tips escrow until market-cap tranches unlock. Bigger upside, later.</div>
              </button>
              <button class="mode" type="button" data-mode="lock">
                <div class="mode__ic"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></svg></div>
                <div class="mode__t">Lock</div>
                <div class="mode__d">Accrues from day one but only unlocks after a fixed hold window.</div>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- step 2 -->
        <div class="step" id="step2">
          <div class="step__head">
            <div class="step__num">2</div>
            <div>
              <div class="step__title">The image</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step__sub">your coin's face</div>
          <div class="step__body">
            <p style="margin-bottom:16px">Add your own: PNG, JPG, GIF or WebP, up to 3 MB. Square works best.</p>
            <label class="upload" id="upload" for="imgInput">
              <div class="upload__ic"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M17 8l-5-5-5 5"/><path d="M12 3v12"/></svg></div>
              <div class="upload__t" id="uploadText">Choose a file</div>
              <div class="upload__d">or drop it here</div>
              <input type="file" id="imgInput" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp" hidden>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- step 3 -->
        <div class="step" id="step3">
          <div class="step__head">
            <div class="step__num">3</div>
            <div>
              <div class="step__title">Name it and launch</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step__sub">pump.fun</div>
          <div class="step__body">
            <p style="margin-bottom:18px">The coin launches from your own wallet, and the only cost is Solana's network fee.</p>

            <div class="fgrid">
              <div class="field">
                <label class="field__l" for="fName">Name <span class="cnt" id="cntName">0/32</span></label>
                <input type="text" id="fName" maxlength="32" placeholder="Lumen">
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label class="field__l" for="fTicker">Ticker <span class="cnt" id="cntTicker">0/10</span></label>
                <input type="text" id="fTicker" maxlength="10" placeholder="LUMEN">
              </div>
              <div class="field field--full">
                <label class="field__l" for="fHandle">Creator's handle <span class="dim" style="letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none">their page</span></label>
                <input type="text" id="fHandle" maxlength="32" placeholder="lumen">
                <div class="field__h">The handle the Cut is bound to. On a Creator Launch you sign a challenge to prove it is yours; on a Fan Launch it stays unclaimed until they do.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="field field--full">
                <label class="field__l" for="fX">Link a post on X <span class="dim" style="letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none">optional</span></label>
                <input type="text" id="fX" placeholder="https://x.com/you/status/…">
                <div class="field__h">A post about your coin. It becomes the coin's X link on pump.fun and shows on its page here.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="field field--full">
                <label class="field__l" for="fDesc">Description <span class="dim" style="letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none">optional</span></label>
                <textarea id="fDesc" maxlength="280" placeholder="What does this coin pay its creator for?"></textarea>
                <div class="field__h">We add a line saying the coin was launched on OnlyPad and how its reward is split.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:22px" class="field">
              <label class="field__l" for="fCut">The creator's Cut <span class="cnt" id="cutValue">60%</span></label>
              <input type="range" id="fCut" min="40" max="80" step="5" value="60"
                     style="width:100%;accent-color:var(--accent);margin-top:6px">
              <div class="field__h">
                How much of the reward goes to the creator. The Pad always takes one eighth of what is left,
                so the rest is the Subs' Tips. <b style="color:var(--ink-2)">60% is the default and the number we would pick:</b>
                below it the creator is underpaid, above it there is nothing left to make the coin worth holding.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:20px" class="field">
              <label class="field__l">Pool liquidity pair <span class="dim" style="letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none">default SOL</span></label>
              <div class="seg" id="pairGroup">
                <button type="button" class="is-on" data-pair="SOL">◎ SOL</button>
                <button type="button" data-pair="USDC">$ USDC</button>
                <button type="button" data-pair="Custom">+ Custom</button>
              </div>
              <div class="field__h">Buyers trade your coin with SOL, and the creator's Cut is paid in SOL.</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:20px" class="field">
              <label class="field__l" for="fBid">Starting bid <span class="dim" style="letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none">optional</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="fBid" placeholder="0.0" inputmode="decimal">
              <div class="field__h">Paid to the Pad wallet before your coin launches. Leave it at 0 to pay nothing.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- preview -->
      <aside class="preview">
        <div class="pcard">
          <div class="pcard__h">
            <span class="t">Your coin</span>
            <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
              <span class="tag tag--verified" id="prevBadge">VERIFIED</span>
              <span class="pill pill--soft" id="prevModePill"><span class="dot"></span>Stream</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="pcard__b">
            <div class="pcoin">
              <div class="pcoin__av" id="prevAv">?</div>
              <div>
                <div class="pcoin__n" id="prevName">Claim Coin</div>
                <div class="pcoin__t" id="prevTicker">$—</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:22px">
              <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Reward split</span><span class="prow__v primary" id="prevSplitTop">60 / 35 / 5</span></div>
              <div class="psplit psplit--3" id="prevSplitBar">
                <i class="a" style="width:60%"></i><i class="b" style="width:35%"></i><i class="c" style="width:5%"></i>
              </div>
              <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">The Cut → creator</span><span class="prow__v primary" id="prevCutRow">60%</span></div>
              <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Tips → OnlyVault</span><span class="prow__v secondary" id="prevTipsRow">35%</span></div>
              <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Pad cut → $ONLY</span><span class="prow__v amber" id="prevPadRow">5%</span></div>
              <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Coin type</span><span class="prow__v" id="prevKind">Creator Launch</span></div>
              <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Pool pair</span><span class="prow__v" id="prevPair">◎ SOL</span></div>
              <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Starting bid</span><span class="prow__v" id="prevBid">—</span></div>
            </div>

            <div class="gcard__esc" id="prevEscrowNote" style="margin-top:16px">
              The Cut streams to your wallet on every trade, from the first one.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pcard">
          <div class="pcard__b">
            <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">OnlyVault</span><span class="prow__v">vault…only</span></div>
            <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Pad treasury</span><span class="prow__v">pad…only</span></div>
            <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Creator Escrow</span><span class="prow__v">esc…only</span></div>
            <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Website on pump.fun</span><span class="prow__v">onlypad.site/only/…</span></div>
            <div class="prow"><span class="prow__k">Est. network cost</span><span class="prow__v">≈ 0.01 SOL</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="launchbar">
          <label class="checkline">
            <input type="checkbox" id="agree">
            <span>I agree to the <a href="#faq">Terms</a>. This creates a real coin on Solana and can't be undone.</span>
          </label>
          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--full btn--lg" id="launchBtn" type="button" disabled>Launch on pump.fun</button>
          <div class="field__h" style="text-align:center" id="launchHint">Connect a wallet and tick the box to enable.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= BOARD ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="board">
  <div class="boardglow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="eyebrow">Launches</div>
      <h2 class="h-xl">Every Only launched here.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Ranked by market cap. <b>$ONLY</b> sits at the top as the platform coin. Every card shows what has reached the creator, what is still waiting for them, and what their Subs can claim right now.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="board__bar rv">
      <div class="search">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
        <input type="text" id="boardSearch" placeholder="Search a creator or an Only" aria-label="Search Onlys">
      </div>
      <div class="chips" id="boardFilters">
        <button class="is-on" type="button" data-filter="all">All</button>
        <button type="button" data-filter="verified">Verified</button>
        <button type="button" data-filter="unclaimed">Unclaimed</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid rv" id="boardGrid">
      <div class="empty">Loading the board…</div>
    </div>

    <div class="board__foot rv">
      <span class="dim" id="boardMeta">—</span>
      <a class="btnlink" href="#launch">Launch a coin for someone →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= CREATORS ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="creators">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="eyebrow">For creators</div>
      <h2 class="h-xl">If a coin was made for you,<br>your cut is already waiting.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        A fan can launch an Only for you without asking. Nothing is taken from you when they do — your
        <b>Cut accrues in Creator Escrow</b> from the first trade, and it is yours the moment you prove the
        handle is yours. Until then the coin carries an <b>UNCLAIMED</b> badge and cannot use your name.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="epoch">

      <div class="ofpanel rv">
        <div class="ofcover">
          <span class="tag tag--unclaimed ofcover__mode">Waiting</span>
          <span class="tag tag--unclaimed ofcover__badge">UNCLAIMED</span>
          <div class="ofcover__mark">escrow</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ofpanel__b">
          <div class="ofav">?</div>
          <div class="ofid">
            <div class="ofid__n">Your creator page</div>
            <div class="ofid__h">whoever the coin was made for</div>
          </div>
          <p class="ofpromise">A fan can launch an Only for you without asking. Your Cut accrues here from the
            first trade and pays out in one go the moment you prove the handle is yours.</p>

          <div class="ofstats">
            <div class="is-warn"><b id="escTotal">—</b><span>In escrow</span></div>
            <div><b id="escCount">—</b><span>Unclaimed</span></div>
            <div><b>12 mo</b><span>Then returns</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ofstrip" id="escStrip"></div>

          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--full btn--lg ofaction" id="verifyBtn" type="button">Verify a handle and claim</button>
          <div class="ofcue">You sign a challenge with your wallet. We never ask for a password, and we never ask for your login.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lbcard rv">
        <div class="lbcard__h">
          <div>
            <div class="h-md">How verification works</div>
            <div class="dim mono" style="font-size:.72rem;margin-top:4px">four steps, no support ticket</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:6px 24px 20px">
          <div class="vstep">
            <div class="vstep__n">1</div>
            <div>
              <div class="vstep__t">Sign a challenge</div>
              <div class="vstep__d">Your wallet signs a fixed message. It proves you control the address, and it costs nothing.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="vstep">
            <div class="vstep__n">2</div>
            <div>
              <div class="vstep__t">Bind the wallet to your handle</div>
              <div class="vstep__d">Post the signature on your page, or confirm it from a link we give you. That is what turns a handle into a claim.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="vstep">
            <div class="vstep__n">3</div>
            <div>
              <div class="vstep__t">Claim the escrowed Cut</div>
              <div class="vstep__d">Every SOL that accrued while you were unverified pays out in one transaction. Nothing is withheld.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="vstep">
            <div class="vstep__n">4</div>
            <div>
              <div class="vstep__t">Take control of the coin</div>
              <div class="vstep__d">The badge flips to <b>VERIFIED</b>, and the name, the avatar and the description become yours to edit. From then on the Cut streams to you on every trade.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lbcard__f">
          <span class="dim" style="font-size:.78rem">
            OnlyFans has no public API. We cannot see your account, and we never ask for it —
            verification binds a wallet to a handle, nothing more.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= TIP JAR ================= -->
<section class="sec" id="jar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <div class="eyebrow">The Tip Jar · every 15 minutes</div>
      <h2 class="h-xl">The jar refills every 15 minutes.<br>Claim your share.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        The Pad's 5% of every Only buys <b>$ONLY</b>. Half of it burns; the other half drops into the
        <b>Tip Jar</b>, which Subs claim in <b>Drops</b> weighted by the same Proof of Sub rule as every
        OnlyVault. Miss a Drop and nothing is lost — unclaimed Drops <b>stack</b>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="epoch">

      <div class="claimcard rv">
        <div class="claimcard__h">
          <span class="eyebrow">Drop <span id="dropNo">#—</span></span>
