  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band rv">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Get started</div>
      <h2 class="h-xl" style="margin-top:14px">Launch a coin that <span class="accent">pays your creator.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">Pick who it is for, add an image, name it, and go. Every trade from then on pays them — and pays the Subs who stayed.</p>
      <div class="band__cta">
